# Text files are LF in every checkout, Windows included. Some files are
# compared byte for byte (the generated docs/api/tools.md, insta snapshots,
# canonical JSON), and a CRLF checkout (core.autocrlf) would make them differ.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touched: binary fonts, images and documents.
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.forma binary
*.seed binary
